  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The incumbent Studio ink world",
    "overview": "Studio is a working desk: quiet violet-black chrome surrounds a lit, tenant-branded artifact. NEXUS retains its original specialist identity while the conversation, saved work and version history share one workspace. This records the established system rather than choosing a new world.\n\nThis file applies to the Studio window rendered through `src/solo/vibe.tsx` and the Home, Session, Stage and inspector components in this directory. The repository root DESIGN.md explicitly excludes Studio. This scoped record does not govern Team Hub handoff surfaces, other SOLO departments, public marketing, or a tenant's published page design. PRODUCT.md supplies durable mobile, keyboard and reduced-motion commitments; its public Twilight identity is not Studio chrome authority.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Ink layers, translucent panels and hairline seams.",
      "Violet working states; gold publication authority.",
